NEARS-494 v2 — TASK BUG: Null-check NPE building CartItemWidget for an optimistically-added row
Captured live via Dart Tooling Daemon (get_runtime_errors) on emulator-5556, build feat/NEARS-494-cart-authoritative-v2.

Exception caught by widgets library:
  The following _TypeError was thrown building CartItemWidget(dirty, state: _CartItemWidgetState#7d46a):
  Null check operator used on a null value

  The relevant error-causing widget was:
    CartItemWidget  cart_screen.dart:228:56

  When the exception was thrown, this was the stack:
    #0  PricingService.setupAddonsText (package:sixam_mart/features/cart/domain/services/pricing_service.dart:213:40)
    #1  _CartItemWidgetState.build (package:sixam_mart/features/cart/widgets/cart_item_widget.dart:71:39)
    #2  StatefulElement.build (framework.dart:5931:27)
    ... (normal element mounting / sliver list layout frames)

ROOT CAUSE:
  pricing_service.dart:213  ->  `for (var addOn in cart.item!.addOns!) {`
  The optimistic add path (CartController.optimisticAddToCart -> _buildOptimisticRow) stores the
  grid/search CARD Item object as cart.item. List/search card JSON does not populate `add_ons`, so
  card Item.addOns == null (item_model.dart only sets addOns=[] when the `add_ons` key is present in JSON).
  On a successful sync, _adoptServerRow stamps only the server cart id onto the local row — it does NOT
  replace cart.item with the server item — so cart.item.addOns stays null. When the basket (CartItemWidget)
  rebuilds that row before a full getCartDataOnline re-fetch (e.g. while already on the basket and a global
  update() fires), setupAddonsText derefs `cart.item!.addOns!` -> NPE -> the line fails to build.

REPRO (timing-dependent / intermittent): add a simple store-1 item from a grid/search card, be on the basket
  when a global update() rebuilds the row before getCartDataOnline replaces _cartList with server rows.

IMPACT: a cart line throws during build (red error box in release-less builds; broken/blank line in release),
  on the core add-to-cart redesign path. setupVariationText / calculateAddonPrice walk the same nullable lists.
